Third-party code and data used in this prototype

1. cyanbox (https://github.com/cyanreg/cyanbox), BSD 2-clause license

   Used in: src/cyankey.rs (port of src/analysis/key.c to Rust, including the 72 fitted
   template weights, major bias, softmax temperature and confidence calibration constants,
   and Sha'ath's profile table used for tie-breaking) and src/mp3.rs (port of the MPEG frame
   scan and the "frame map" rule of src/audio/mp3.c).

   Origin of the numbers: the template weights were fitted by cyanbox's author on the
   GiantSteps MTG key set (1159 tracks, annotations by Faraldo et al.); the GiantSteps MTG
   repository carries no licence file. Sha'ath's profiles are taken from libKeyFinder's
   constants.cpp (GPL-3.0 library, constants quoted as data by cyanbox). Not fitted on the
   Beatport EDM Key set (CC BY-SA 4.0) used to benchmark.

